      "content": "That timeline is unacceptable. The directive specifically mandates the phase-out be completed within 48 hours to align with the upcoming hardware migration. \n\nYou are to bypass the quarterly projection and provide a migration schedule that concludes within the 48-hour window stipulated in the Ministry's order. Adjust your resource allocation immediately to prioritize this handover.",
